====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[newt]], especially a [[smooth newt]] ({{taxlink|Lissotriton vulgaris|species}}, syn. {{taxlink|Triturus punctatus|species}}), of Europe.
#* {{RQ:Spenser Faerie Queene|V|10|text=Only these marishes and myrie bogs, / In which the fearefull '''ewftes''' do build their bowres, / Yeeld me an hostry mongst the croking frogs […].}}
#* '''1844''', {{w|Robert Browning}}, "Garden Fancies," II. Sibrandus Schafnaburgennis:

=====Usage notes=====
The term ''{{vern|red eft}}'' is used for the land-dwelling juvenile stage of the {{vern|eastern newt}} ({{taxlink|Notophthalmus viridescens|species}}).  {{1|evet}} is an older term

